   "prompt": "Build an energy curve widget like Rise's.\n- Medium widget 344 x 162 pt, 24 pt corners. Left panel #16151A, right panel #000000, split by the curve.\n- Text column at x 18: Evening peak (Work Sans Semibold 17 pt, #FFFFFF), a 4 x 11 pt #FD8008 bar with Until 21:21 (13 pt #BCBCC0), then 31m (Work Sans Light 35 pt, #F8980C).\n- Bottom: Wind-down (13 pt #FFFFFF), a 4 x 10 pt bar #653DC1 to #DE867A, 21:41-22:21 (13 pt #BCBCC0).\n- Time axis at x 164, right-aligned: 6a, 10a, 2p, 6p, 10p (10 pt #908F94), 27 pt apart, 6 x 1 pt #4D4D4F dashes between.\n- Energy curve: 3.5 pt round stroke, purple #6F1DFE at its troughs, orange #FC800C at its peaks.\n- Now marker: 1 pt white line and a 4 pt white dot with a 1 pt black ring. Below it the curve stays purple.\n- Event: 4.6 x 27 pt #FD8008 bar, name and 19:00-21:00 in 13 pt white.\n- Add button: 40 pt #6D1EF5 circle, #9156FC rim, white plus 19 pt, 3 pt stroke.\n- Data rule: refresh every 15 to 30 min so 31m and the now marker move.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
