   "prompt": "Build a guided session card like Rise's.\n- Card 368.5 x 199 pt, 13 pt corners: art 138.5 pt tall on top, footer row 60.5 pt below.\n- Art: vertical gradient #4C0210 (top), #963907 (middle), #DF7001 (bottom).\n- Two waves behind the disc: a 1.5 pt #97460E wave with 4 crests across the card, and a 1 pt #83221B wave between y 35 and 40.5 pt with a 63 pt period.\n- Play disc: 34 pt #FEFEFF circle centered 34 pt from the top, with an 11 x 13 pt #6F1A0C triangle 1.7 pt right of center.\n- Title: Reduce stress, Work Sans Regular 17 pt, #FFFFFF, centered, baseline 78.5 pt.\n- Subtitle: 11m guided session, Work Sans Bold 15 pt, #FFFFFF, centered, baseline 102 pt.\n- Footer #22222A: About autogenic training (Work Sans Regular 17 pt, white) at x 13 pt, and a 10.6 x 19 pt chevron, 2.5 pt stroke, 12 pt from the right edge.\n- States: tap the art or disc to play; pressed disc scales to 0.94. While audio plays, slide the waves on an 8 s loop and show a pause icon. Pressed footer: #2A2A33.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
