   "prompt": "Build a habit list sheet like Rise's.\n- Sheet #16151A, 28 pt top corners, 1 pt #333237 top edge, 36 x 5 pt white grabber 8 pt from the top.\n- Header: Habits (Work Sans Regular 22 pt, white) at x 14, baseline 42 pt. At right, a 122 x 21 pt pill with a 1 pt #333237 border.\n- Pill content: a 9 x 12 pt bolt (gradient #1ECCBA to #7A72E9), then GREAT in (13 pt #FCFCFC) and 1 day (13 pt Bold #8C58FC).\n- List 367 pt wide, 13 pt margins, 12 pt corners, 1 pt #333237 border. Rows 56.5 pt, #22222A, 1 pt #323335 separators.\n- Row: 21 pt color circle with a flat glyph at 13 pt inset, label at x 43 (Work Sans Regular 17 pt, white), a 17 pt bell, then a 10.5 x 19 pt chevron with a 2.5 pt stroke.\n- Last row on #16151A: a 21 pt plus (1.5 pt stroke) and Add a habit in Work Sans Bold 16 pt #8C58FC.\n- States: filled bell = reminder on, outline bell = off. Pressed row: #2C2B33. Drag to reorder lifts a row to 1.03x scale.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  }
